  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;b&gt;The SB4U-WeWork-UE project&lt;/b&gt;, Green and decent jobs for youth, contributes to sustainable economic growth and decent job creation in Uganda. The main objectives are : (1) increased employability of youth, (2) supply of qualified workers, and (3) access to decent employment especially in green economy sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
